        "id": 12097,
        "name": "Benhimself",
        "username": "Benhimself",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-25T08:13:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay, say the Operative is picking a fight with Citizen Dawn, and of course Citizen Truth is in play.<br><br>If the Operative uses Kusarigama on Citizen Dawn, does the movement happen before Citizen Truth gets a chance to redirect (and thus possibly taking Dawn out of Citizen Truth's line of sight?) Or would Citizen Truth, redirecting the attack to himself, be the one who gets moved?<br><br>If the Operative uses Undivided Attention on Citizen Dawn, does she still get the bonus two attack dice if she initially strikes at Dawn&nbsp;even if Citizen Truth takes the attack?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:32.824Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 12097,
        "topic_slug": "operative-vs-citizen-truth",
        "display_username": "Benhimself",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
