        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Okay, say the Operative is picking a fight with Citizen Dawn, and of course Citizen Truth is in play.<br /><br />If the Operative uses Kusarigama on Citizen Dawn, does the movement happen before Citizen Truth gets a chance to redirect (and thus possibly taking Dawn out of Citizen Truth&#39;s line of sight?) Or would Citizen Truth, redirecting the attack to himself, be the one who gets moved?<br /><br />If the Operative uses Undivided Attention on Citizen Dawn, does she still get the bonus two attack dice if she initially strikes at Dawn&nbsp;even if Citizen Truth takes the attack?</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 4109,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
        "deleted_at": null,
        "user_deleted": false,
        "edit_reason": null,
        "can_view_edit_history": true,
        "wiki": false,
        "can_accept_answer": false,
        "can_unaccept_answer": false,
        "accepted_answer": false,
        "topic_accepted_answer": false
      },
      {
        "id": 129322,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-25T09:01:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Citizen Truth says to reassign the dice&nbsp;when you roll for the attack so it looks like you'd still get the bonus dice from Undivided Attention&nbsp;as you had already rolled them before reassigning them to Truth.</p><p>As for the Kursarigama, it doesn't say to change the target of the attack. Looks like Truth would still reassign the dice to him but&nbsp;Dawn would be the one that gets moved. Not completely sure on this one though.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:14.621Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 12097,
        "topic_slug": "operative-vs-citizen-truth",
        "display_username": "Koga",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
