        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Citizen Truth says to reassign the dice&nbsp;when you roll for the attack so it looks like you&#39;d still get the bonus dice from Undivided Attention&nbsp;as you had already rolled them before reassigning them to Truth.</p><p>As for the Kursarigama, it doesn&#39;t say to change the target of the attack. Looks like Truth would still reassign the dice to him but&nbsp;Dawn would be the one that gets moved. Not completely sure on this one though.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
