        "id": 129323,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-27T03:52:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Truth becomes the defender against the attack, so any effects of the attack would apply to Truth, including picking him up and setting him adjacent to The Operative.</p><p>It will work for any other effects of attacks as well.</p>",
